# Ignore unnecessary files and directories

## 🔹 Compilation and Package Files
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

## 🔹 Logs and Error Reports
*.log
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

## 🔹 Development Tools

### 🟢 Spring Tool Suite (STS)
.apt_generated
.classpath
.factorypath
.project
.settings/
.springBeans
.sts4-cache/

### 🟣 IntelliJ IDEA
.idea/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr

### 🔵 NetBeans
/nbproject/private/
/nbbuild/
/dist/
/nbdist/
/.nb-gradle/
build/
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/

### 🟠 VS Code
.vscode/

## 🔹 Temporary Files and J2ME
.mtj.tmp/
target/
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/

### Backup Files and Archives
backup

### 🔹 Environment Variables
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.secrets
.secrets.*
.secrets/

### 🔹 Vault
.vault_pass
vault/data/
vault/data/**